1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,029
Remove the toilet ring without hard
scrubbing.

2
00:00:03,233 --> 00:00:03,766
One.

3
00:00:04,057 --> 00:00:07,020
Turn off the water valve, flush, and let

4
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:09,328
the water level drop below the ring.

5
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:10,205
Two.

6
00:00:10,497 --> 00:00:12,960
Pour white vinegar or citric acid on the

7
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:15,628
